# The health gate of the shared address (phase 2 gaps, design note section 1): the ONE place in
# the build context for the gate file and for the three agent flags. The agent code can still
# rename a flag: change it here, and nowhere else. The build makes two files from these values:
#   /usr/local/bin/podvm-endpoint-ready                                   (from podvm-endpoint-ready.in)
#   /etc/systemd/system/nvke-agent.service.d/zz-podvm-endpoint-gate.conf  (the three flags)
# Shell syntax: the Dockerfile reads this file with ".".
GATE_FILE=/var/lib/nvke/control-plane-endpoint.gate
BACKEND_INTERFACE=eth0
GATE_SETTLE=15s
AGENT_GATE_FLAGS="--control-plane-endpoint-gate-file=${GATE_FILE} --control-plane-endpoint-backend-interface=${BACKEND_INTERFACE} --control-plane-endpoint-gate-settle=${GATE_SETTLE}"
